# WASM-PHALANX — 12-role assignment for real emit-wasm bodies

File: openOODA/audit/wasm_phalanx.oot
Owner named this leftover. C emit + gcc stays the everyday path.
Browser WASM host is residual. Do not sell it.

## 1. Ship bar

  A fixture that is only `println("Hello, openOODA!");` in `main`
  must emit a `\0asm` module whose `main` / `_start` body is WASI
  `fd_write` of that literal, not dummy `02 00 0b`.
  `wasmtime` (if present) must print that line and exit 0.
  Other functions may keep dummy `end` this cycle.
  Magic `\0asm` and `ooda-fns` stay. Existing magic smokes must still pass.

## 2. Frozen API (do not rename)

  Existing (keep):
    void oo_wasm_write_empty_module(void);
    void oo_wasm_write_source_module(long long fn_count);
    void oo_wasm_note_fn(OoStr name);

  New:
    void oo_wasm_set_fn_print(OoStr s);
  Meaning: the last `oo_wasm_note_fn` name gets a WASI fd_write body
  of bytes `s` plus a trailing newline if `s` has none.
  If a name has no print, keep dummy `end`.
  Add WASI import only when at least one print body exists.
  Import name: `wasi_snapshot_preview1` / `fd_write`.
  Type: `(i32 i32 i32 i32) -> i32`. fd=1 (stdout).

  Compiler helper (DE2 owns the body):
    pub fn wasm_fn_println_lit(src: String, fname: String) -> String
  Return the string literal inside a body that is only `println("...");`.
  Return "" if the body is anything else.

## 3. File ownership (disjoint)

  DE1   ooda/oodac/wasm_emit.oo
        plus only the wasm name rows in
        ooda/oodac/tc_names_known.oo
        ooda/oodac/tc_call_arity.oo
  DE2   ooda/oodac/wasm_emit_fn.oo
        ooda/oodac/wasm_emit_stmt.oo
        (add wasm_fn_println_lit; do not print WAT on the product path)
  RT    ooda/runtime/chs_rt_wasm.c
        ooda/runtime/chs_rt_wasm_print.c   (new if split; 256-line C)
        one include line in ooda/runtime/chs_rt.c
        wasm decls only in ooda/runtime/chs_rt.h
        one prototype line in ooda/oodac/c_emit_preamble.oo
  PV1   ooda/fixtures/wasm_empty.oo
        ooda/fixtures/wasm_nofn.oo
        openOODA/audit/wasm_pv1.oot
  PV2   openOODA/audit/wasm_pv2.oot
