        openOODA/audit/wasm_docs.oot
  COORD openOODA/audit/wasm_coord.oot

## 4. Forbidden

  No .py .sh .md .js. No llvm_emit*.oo. No c_emit*.oo except the one
  preamble prototype. No lex/parse/check/tc except the two DE1 rows.
  Do not copy bin/ooda onto oodac/oodac.
  Do not claim a browser host. Do not retire C emit + gcc.

## 5. Proof

  From ooda/:
    ./oodac/oodac emit-wasm fixtures/wasm_print_hi.oo > /tmp/hi.wasm
    od -An -tx1 -N8 /tmp/hi.wasm
    wasmtime /tmp/hi.wasm
  Rebuild only if you own oodac/*.oo or runtime and you must run emit.
  Official rebuild: bootstrap/oodac_pure_build. Do not race three rebuilds.
  Prefer gcc of a tiny C driver against chs_rt.c for RT-only proof.
